abstract: >-
  Research code and 72 executed PLEXOS runs accompanying a study of vehicle-to-grid
  demand response in local energy communities. The repository includes carbon-accounting
  functions and simulation inputs and outputs, but not the complete workflow for
  regenerating every paper table and figure.
url: "https://github.com/GreenPow-Labs/v2g-lec-multi-market-arbitrage"
